here else so that's a quick  overview about my drive the Google Drive  program and how I use it again I use it  mainly to collaborate with my team I  found it really super easy to share  files and edit them together much easier  than other project management tools I  use it to run surveys with my audience  and find out what they're interested in  and I use it to run mail merges when I  have important emails I don't want to  send out that can be customized so  hopefully that was interesting and gives  you a few ideas of things that you might  be able to do with your business if you  guys liked the video and you want to see  more please give it a thumbs up below  what makes you want to do more of these  videos for you and if you have a  question about Google Drive or another  tool or anything else about your  business feel free to leave it in the  comments below I always read those and I  look forward to hearing from you so  we'll see you on the next episode Cheers  you
 

